    "title": "Craighead County Veterans Day Parade - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By IL Editor ,\n1 days ago The Craighead County Veteran’s Monument Foundation invites everyone to line the streets of Downtown Jonesboro on Saturday, November 1, 2025, for the annual Veterans Day Parade — celebrating 250 years of Veterans and recognizing the Army, Navy, Marines, and all who have served. Date: Saturday, November 1, 2025. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
